WEBVTT

00:06:28.994 --> 00:06:31.640
Design-wise, it manages
to both be too crude

00:06:31.664 --> 00:06:34.476
and have too many details
at the same time,

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.191
which if you were trying for that,

00:06:36.215 --> 00:06:38.132
you wouldn't be able to do it,

00:06:38.156 --> 00:06:39.906
and it just looks bad at a distance,

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:43.598
but having deep meaning
puts that element in the plus column.

00:06:43.622 --> 00:06:46.822
Behind the phoenix,
the background is mostly white,

00:06:46.846 --> 00:06:50.151
and then it has a substantial
gold border around it.

00:06:50.175 --> 00:06:52.844
TK: Which is a very attractive
design element.

00:06:53.295 --> 00:06:54.593
RM: I think it's OK, but --

00:06:54.617 --> 00:06:56.176
(Laughter)

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:59.196
here come the big no-nos of flag design.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.617
Narrator: Number four,
no lettering or seals.